 <metadata>
  <name>Prestwich run around</name>
  <desc>from Aldi, down to the subway and over, through that little cut through which brings us out on to bury old road, 1st right on to Nursey rd, at the bottom turn right along Heys rd, past Heys Sch, turn left, up the tiny little hill, cross over the road, straight on to where the shops are, left turn on to mount rd, over sandgate, left on to Thatch Leech lane, at the top turn right back to Aldi. </desc>
  <author>
   <name>Run Together Whitefield</name>
   <link href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/44862010"/>
  </author>
